[[File:Cave kraken icon.png|left]]
'''Cave kraken''' are [[slayer monsters]] that are found in the [[Kraken Cove]]. They can only be attacked if players have them as a [[Slayer task]]. To be assigned cave krakens, players require level 87 [[Slayer]] and 50 [[Magic]]. Along with their boss variant, the [[Kraken]], they are the only monsters to drop the [[kraken tentacle]] and the [[trident of the seas]].

In order to fight a cave kraken, a player must first "disturb" one of the many whirlpools found within the cove. [[Fishing explosive|Fishing explosives]] cannot be used to surface the regular cave kraken like one might their boss counterpart.

[[Magic]] is the only reliable way of dealing damage to the cave kraken, as [[Ranged]] attacks deals 1/7th of its normal damage and [[Melee]] cannot be used, including halberds.  Their attacks are [[Magic damage|magic]] rather than [[typeless]] (meaning they can be prayed against). 

The [[Kraken]] boss is generally more favourable to kill for Kraken slayer tasks. Outside of ironmen seeking their first trident of the seas, which drops at a more frequent rate than the full charged one from the boss, or collection log completionists specifically looking for the uncharged trident log slot, there is little incentive to kill them over the boss as their drop table is significantly less lucrative.

